# Build outputs stay out of the image: the local `target/` holds another
# platform's objects, and copying it only bloats the build context. Every
# one, at any depth, and what agents and benchmarks keep in the checkout --
# worktrees under .claude/ (4.6 GB on one machine), BEIR's corpora under
# fenec-bench (2.1 GB): tools/image-cargo.sh keeps a second copy of the
# context and compares it each build, which they cost 16 s the first time
# and 8 s each after.
target/
**/target/
.claude/
crates/fenec-bench/beir/
web/fenec.wasm
pkg/
node_modules/
# Every package's, at any depth: integrations/grafana's is 600 MB, and the
# Grafana image (integrations/grafana/Dockerfile) installs its own.
**/node_modules/
integrations/grafana/dist/

# Data and local leftovers
*.fenec
.DS_Store
.git/
